倒在船板之上。杀气弥漫，蓝雅清楚的从他眼中看到了死亡，他真的想要杀她，想到此，她那冰冷的眼眸之中释放着寒气，那冰冷犹如坠入万年严寒之地的感觉，不亚于对方男人的一种冰冷。她那眼神之中的冰冷，逐野狂冥眸子里竟然闪过一丝的惊讶！这个女人……一个女人竟然有如此的冰冷……“这种眼神若是毁了还真可惜。”口气像冰刀，眼光寒峻，语气之中却带着一丝玩味：“本王改变注意了。”蓝雅没有任何的惊讶，她说过没有什么好怕的，死与活她不在乎，死或许也是一种解脱。轻轻的闭上眼睛，耳边传来呼啸声，她浑身一颤，双腿钻心的疼痛，让她猛然睁开眼睛，血肉模糊的双腿，在她眼眸之中映出。疼痛到麻木双腿颤动着，血不断的涌出，血浆凝聚，大红的颜色，让她淡然无比，她知道她的双腿废了。抬头看着神人一般的男子，嘴角扯出一抹不逊的笑容，死她都不怕，更不会在意失去双腿。“真没种，你们这种人都没种杀了我……”她笑了，笑的妖娆，眼睛越来越沉，激怒他的话有气无力的从她的口中溢出……昏迷前，她很满意的看到一张冰冷的脸青筋暴跳，长剑朝着她的胸口刺下……死，其实她很怕死，可是她没有选择。现在死了，或许会比活着更好，死了，就不会被他们控制……蓝雅再次醒来的时候已经是四天之后，她坐在朱红的大床之上，眼神有些迷离，看向四周古色古香的家具摆设，她没死？昏迷之前她明明看到了那个男人暴怒的样子，他没有恼羞成怒杀了她？坐起身子，稍稍一动，双腿疼的让她直冒冷汗，掀开被子，看着包扎好的双腿，眼神闪了闪，心中百般的疑惑。‘吱嘎’一声，那紧闭的门被人推开，一名小大约十五六岁的丫鬟走了进来。小丫鬟看到床上做起来的蓝雅怔了一下‘哐当’手中的铜盆落在地上发出巨大的声音，水洒落一地。蓝雅皱起眉头，直直的看着身穿古装的女孩，女孩眼中的欣喜一栏在她的眼中：“你……”“小姐……你醒了，呜呜……小姐……你终于醒了！”小丫鬟反应过来，跑到床前，又笑又哭。“这是那？”蓝雅见女孩没有恶意，便开口询问。小丫鬟又是一怔，有些惊讶：“小姐，这是你家啊。”家？蓝雅心头一愣，家？转眼环视周围的景象，家？古装？“这个国家叫什么？”蓝雅收了收心思，心中隐隐发现不对劲，银月家族不是一个向往古典的家族，相对来说对中国古典相当的厌恶。穿越这个念头在她脑海浮现，穿越？可能吗？“小姐，你你……你不会失忆了吧？”小丫鬟瞪大眼睛，满眼的不可置信。蓝雅疲惫的闭了闭眼睛，声音清凉：“失忆，或许吧。”新文新气象，本文有宠有虐，还有聪明宝宝，女主一步一步变强，爱情感人至深。", "source": "www.quanwenyuedu.io", "source_url": "https://www.quanwenyuedu.io/n/shenyiqifei/6.html", "_fixed": true, "content_en": "With his legs gone, Zhuye Kuang Ming's white fingers moved, and he lifted Lan Ya's chin, with a mocking smile on his face, but a murderous look in his eyes: \"The dead don't deserve to know.\" After finishing his words, he moved his fingers that lifted his chin, and Lanya, who was already unstable, fell to the board of the ship with a 'bump'. Murderous aura filled the air, and Lanya could clearly see death in his eyes. He really wanted to kill her. Thinking of this, her cold eyes released a cold air. The coldness was like falling into a cold place for thousands of years, no less cold than the other man. The coldness in her eyes, and a trace of surprise flashed in Zhuye Kuangming's eyes! This woman... a woman can be so cold... \"It would be a pity if this kind of look is ruined.\" Her tone was like an ice knife, her eyes were cold, but there was a hint of playfulness in her tone: \"I have changed my mind.\" Lanya was not surprised at all. She said that there was nothing to be afraid of. She didn't care about life or death. Death might also be a kind of relief. She closed her eyes gently, and heard a whistling sound in her ears. She trembled all over, and the excruciating pain in her legs made her suddenly open her eyes, and the bloody legs were reflected in her eyes. The pain was so numb that her legs were trembling, blood kept pouring out, the plasma condensed, and the bright red color made her feel extremely calm. She knew that her legs were useless. Looking up at the god-like man, a sly smile appeared on her lips. She was not afraid of death, let alone losing her legs. \"You're so stupid, you guys don't even dare to kill me...\" She smiled, her smile was enchanting, her eyes became darker and darker, and the words that angered him weakly escaped from her mouth... Before she passed out, she was very satisfied to see a cold face with bulging veins, and the long sword stabbed towards her chest... Death, in fact, she was very afraid of death, but she had no choice. Maybe it would be better to die now than to live. If you die, you won't be controlled by them... It was already four days later when Lanya woke up again. She was sitting on the big vermilion bed, her eyes were a little blurred, and she looked at the antique furniture and furnishings around her. She was not dead? Before she fell into coma, she clearly saw the man's furious look. Didn't he kill her in anger? She sat up and moved a little. The pain in her legs made her break into a cold sweat. She lifted the quilt and looked at the bandaged legs. Her eyes flickered and she was filled with doubts. With a creak, the closed door was pushed open, and a maid about fifteen or sixteen years younger walked in. The little maid was startled when she saw Lanya getting up on the bed. The copper basin in her hand fell to the ground with a loud sound, and the water spilled all over the floor. Lan Ya frowned and looked straight at the girl in ancient costume. The girl's eyes were full of joy: \"You...\" \"Miss... you're awake, wuwu... miss... you're finally awake!\" The little maid reacted and ran to the bed, laughing and crying. \"Is this what it is?\" Lan Ya asked after seeing that the girl had no ill intentions. The little maid was startled again, a little surprised: \"Miss, this is your home.\" Home? Lan Ya was stunned, home? Looking around at the scene in a blink of an eye, home? Costume? \"What is the name of this country?\" Lan Ya stopped her thoughts and faintly realized that something was wrong. The Yinyue family was not a family that yearned for classics, and relatively speaking, they had a strong dislike for Chinese classics. The idea of ​​time travel came to her mind, time travel? Is it possible? \"Miss, you...you won't have amnesia, right?\" The little maid's eyes widened in disbelief. Lan Ya closed her eyes tiredly, and said in a cool voice: \"Amnesia, maybe.\" New article, new atmosphere, this article has both pampering and abuse, and a smart baby. The heroine becomes stronger step by step, and the love is deeply touching.", "title_en": "Chapter 6"}